WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:02,450
Dining truck, what kind of dining truck?

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:04,650
There is a dining car on the bloody train

3
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:06,050
Tickets can be repaid on trains

4
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:07,850
Why can't there be a food truck?

5
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:09,850
Where else would this food come from?

6
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,060
Just say it's okay

7
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,860
Little mouse, you are right

8
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:17,660
But the dining room costs extra.

9
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:20,820
Do you have the strength to lead the way?

10
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,460
This is a tip

11
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,680
Please forgive me for being unreasonable just now

12
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,480
Oops, distinguished guest

13
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:32,480
This way please

14
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:37,000
Please be careful and get out of the way

15
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Don't stand in the way of my distinguished guest.

16
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,000
distinguished guest

17
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Watch your step

18
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:47,850
He dropped all the food on the floor

19
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:50,330
Is it a waste?

20
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:52,330
If you lick them all clean

21
00:00:52,330 --> 00:00:53,330
Of course not

22
00:00:53,330 --> 00:00:57,460
Otherwise I will twist his head off with my own hands
